{"id":"n89773-2-9","stage":5,"title":"체육 · 体育","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89773-2-9-1","ko":"온몸이 쑤시고 아파.","zh":"我全身都疼得发酸。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"온몸이","meaning":"全身","explanation":"온몸：全身；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"온몸","audio":"/audio/53813a553060901e944c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67839","senseId":"1","lemma":"온몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온몸이","audio":"/audio/97737dc67ce3e1fda050.mp3"}},{"text":"쑤시고","meaning":"刺痛，酸痛","explanation":"쑤시다：刺痛，酸痛；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쑤시다","audio":"/audio/91758f65153658d67edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66426","senseId":"1","lemma":"쑤시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쑤시고","audio":"/audio/65a321be71a25c12216d.mp3"}},{"text":"아파.","meaning":"疼，痛","explanation":"아프다：疼，痛；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"2","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파","audio":"/audio/f1eadb220a21e78bc17f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"53813a553060901e","term":"온몸","zh":"全身","audio":"/audio/53813a553060901e944c.mp3","entryId":"67839","definition":"身体全部。","pronunciation":["온ː몸"]},{"id":"91758f65153658d6","term":"쑤시다","zh":"刺痛，酸痛","audio":"/audio/91758f65153658d67edd.mp3","entryId":"66426","definition":"身体像用针刺一般疼痛。","pronunciation":["쑤시다"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼，痛","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"身体的某些部位使用过多而感到疲劳或难受。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d873e19401d9028c7c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89773-2-9-2","ko":"너도? 어제 체육 시간에 운동을 심하게 해서 그런지 나도 여기저기가 아파.","zh":"你也是吗？因为昨天体育课上运动太剧烈了，我也觉得到处都疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너도?","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8