41","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9e2ef8f34a6bbf71","term":"여기저기","zh":"到处，这里那里","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3","entryId":"70994","definition":"没有明确定下的多个场所或位置。","pronunciation":["여기저기"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼，痛","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"身体的某些部位使用过多而感到疲劳或难受。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6d043e67efc93c9c60c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.449,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89773","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":166,"sequenceScore":3.2757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你也是吗？因为昨天体育课上运动太剧烈了，我也觉得到处都疼。","我全身都疼得发酸。","哥，过年要向长辈拜年行礼吧，怎么做？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我全身都疼得发酸。","哥，过年要向长辈拜年行礼吧，怎么做？","你也是吗？因为昨天体育课上运动太剧烈了，我也觉得到处都疼。"],"answer":2}]}
